{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31735","headline":"赠智朗禅师 · 贾岛","name":"赠智朗禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人分明见，玉兔潭底没。\n上人光惨貌，古来恨峭发。\n涕辞孔颜庙，笑访禅寂室。\n步随青山影，坐学白塔骨。\n解听无弄琴，不礼有身佛。\n欲问师何之，忽与我相别。\n率赋赠远言，言慙非子曰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}